### Sonde de sante — la seule route ouverte sans jeton
GET http://localhost:8092/actuator/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Parcours eleve — ne voit que ce qui est publie et non archive
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### La FAQ publiee
GET http://localhost:8092/api/v1/faq
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### La FAQ d'une categorie
GET http://localhost:8092/api/v1/faq?category=COMPTE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Les categories qui ont au moins une entree visible
GET http://localhost:8092/api/v1/faq/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Back-office
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Creer une entree — elle doit ressortir en DRAFT
POST http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "code": "CHANGER_CLASSE",
  "category": "COMPTE",
  "question": {
    "fr": "Comment changer de classe ?",
    "en": "How do I change my class?"
  },
  "answer": {
    "fr": "Depuis ton profil, section Scolarite, choisis ta nouvelle classe.",
    "en": "From your profile, under Schooling, pick your new class."
  },
  "position": 10
}

### Tout voir, brouillons et archives compris
GET http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Une entree precise
GET http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq/CHANGER_CLASSE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Modifier — le code envoye doit etre ignore, le statut ne doit pas bouger
PUT http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq/CHANGER_CLASSE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "code": "PEU_IMPORTE",
  "category": "COMPTE",
  "question": {
    "fr": "Comment changer de classe en cours d'annee ?",
    "en": "How do I change class mid-year?"
  },
  "answer": {
    "fr": "Depuis ton profil, section Scolarite.",
    "en": "From your profile, under Schooling."
  },
  "position": 10
}

### Publier
PATCH http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq/CHANGER_CLASSE/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Depublier — repasse en brouillon
PATCH http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq/CHANGER_CLASSE/unpublish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Archiver — l'entree disparait du parcours eleve, pas de la base
PATCH http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq/CHANGER_CLASSE/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Restaurer
PATCH http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq/CHANGER_CLASSE/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Le parcours qui prouve la regle metier — a jouer dans cet ordre
###
###   1. POST                       -> 200, status DRAFT
###   2. GET  /admin/faq            -> l'entree est la
###   3. GET  /api/v1/faq           -> elle n'y est PAS (brouillon)
###   4. PATCH .../publish          -> status PUBLISHED
###   5. GET  /api/v1/faq           -> elle apparait
###   6. PATCH .../archive          -> archived true
###   7. GET  /api/v1/faq           -> elle disparait
###   8. GET  /admin/faq            -> elle est TOUJOURS la
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Controles de securite — a lancer avant de dire que c'est fini
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Sans jeton -> 401
GET http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq

### Avec un jeton d'eleve sur une route admin -> 403
GET http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Entree inconnue -> 404 faq_entry_not_found
GET http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq/N_EXISTE_PAS
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Code deja pris -> 409 faq_code_already_exists
POST http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "code": "CHANGER_CLASSE",
  "category": "COMPTE",
  "question": { "fr": "Doublon", "en": "Duplicate" },
  "answer": { "fr": "Doublon", "en": "Duplicate" },
  "position": 20
}

### Champ manquant -> 400 validation_failed
POST http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "category": "COMPTE",
  "question": { "fr": "Sans code", "en": "No code" }
}

### Texte francais vide -> 400, errors["question.fr"]
POST http://localhost:8092/api/v1/admin/faq
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "code": "TEXTE_VIDE",
  "category": "COMPTE",
  "question": { "fr": "   ", "en": "Blank french" },
  "answer": { "fr": "Reponse", "en": "Answer" },
  "position": 0
}
